{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>何文田發生盜竊案。今日（22日）上午10時59分，警方接獲46歲姓黃女子報案，指其京士柏山道78號京士柏山6座寓所內，有兩枚分別約值20萬及4.5萬元的戒指，及約2,000元現金不翼而飛。</p><p>警方經初步調查，將案件列「盜竊」，交由油尖警區刑事調查隊第九隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><figure><img alt=\"油麻地京士柏山道78號一單位遇竊，暫未有人被捕。（Google Maps截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201233649337372672203594.png/Hu7owc5X3iIobYpRcVrn1iir_9P9E7cLV00YuldNGLo\"/><figcaption>油麻地京士柏山道78號一單位遇竊，暫未有人被捕。（Google Maps截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:24:01.391261+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:03:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T22:37:48.095764+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T11:17:23.964081+00:00","content_hash":"4e160fa4217bca8fb646af6767631970e5e2fadc50ce0aaec47f3eed1a24ee61","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}